{"step_index":1222,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:42:39Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-11T05:42:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T05:42:40+08:00\nCreated At: 2026-11-11T05:42:39+08:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-11T05:42:40+08:00\nShowing lines 125-136 of 136\n125: ### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.22)\n126: - Added silent exam-content obscuration (`.obscure` instant 0ms blur/opacity fade on `#exam`) in `index.html`, triggered on `window` `blur`, `document` `visibilitychange` when hidden, and desktop screenshot shortcut keys (`PrintScreen` and `Cmd/Ctrl+Shift+3/4/5` via `isCaptureKey(e)` + `pulseExamMask()`) without logging violations, incrementing `switches`, displaying alerts, or adding any explanatory text to the UI.\n127: - Added a faint tiled diagonal SVG student-identity watermark overlay (`#wm.wm-layer`, filled with `#7f8799` `escXml(name + ' • ' + section)`) rendered over the exam upon starting via `setWatermark()` and cleared/hidden on `finish()` and `showLock()`.\n128: - Re-applied dual-layer AST obfuscation + stream-cipher hardening to `index.html` (`teacher.html` unchanged) and re-synced `quizzes/template`.\n129: - Why: User requested silent screenshot/capture deterrence without adding violations, alerts, or mentioning its existence anywhere in the UI.\n130: \n131: ### Non-Major (Patch 1.0.23)\n132: - Fixed unconditional remote submission in `index.html`: extracted shared `isAutoRecord()` helper (`!quizData || !quizData.settings || quizData.settings.autoRecordQuiz !== false`) and gated `subData` creation and `EncryptedLocalDB.appendRecord()` in `finish()`, while reusing `isAutoRecord()` in `showLock()` (`#lkdl`).\n133: - Updated the `Submissions` tab (`#view-sub`) in `teacher.html` via `syncSubViewState()`, `stopSubPoller()`, and `syncSubPoller()` so when `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` is `false`, `#clear-sub-btn`, `#sub-count-badge`, and `#sub-desc` are hidden via `.hide`, `#sub-feed` displays `Notice: This is only available to auto record quiz`, `clearSub` modal execution is guarded, and `listRecords(id, signal)` polling stops/aborts in-flight requests whenever Auto Record Quiz is OFF, the Submissions tab is inactive, or `document.hidden` is true.\n134: - Re-applied dual-layer AST obfuscation + stream-cipher hardening to `index.html` and `teacher.html` and re-synced `quizzes/template`.\n135: - Why: Student finishes were still uploading submissions to Firestore when Auto Record Quiz was OFF, and the user requested displaying an auto-record-only notice and hiding Clear Students on the Submissions page when Auto Record Quiz is disabled.\n136: "}
{"step_index":1223,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-10T21:42:40Z","input_tokens":2939,"cache_read_tokens":181879,"output_tokens":1908,"content":"Implemented the Auto Record Quiz submission gate and the Submissions page restriction (`Patch 1.0.23`), hardened both apps, synced the template to Firestore, and updated [HISTORY.md](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md#L131-L135).\n\n### Summary of Changes\n1. **Gated Remote Submissions ([index.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html)):**\n   - Added [`isAutoRecord`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/index.html#L664-L666) (`!quizData || !quizData.settings || quizData.settings.autoRecordQuiz !== false`) and reused it in both [`finish`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/index.html#L668-L756) and [`showLock`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/index.html#L813-L833).\n   - When `autoRecordQuiz` is `false`, `finish()` skips constructing `subData` and skips `EncryptedLocalDB.appendRecord()`, keeping Download/Copy buttons and `localStorage` lock intact.\n2. **Submissions Notice & Polling Control ([teacher.html](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)):**\n   - Updated [`#view-sub`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/teacher.html#L150-L164) and added [`syncSubViewState`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/teacher.html#L397-L412), [`stopSubPoller`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/teacher.html#L370-L380), and [`syncSubPoller`](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/tmp_backup/teacher.html#L382-L395).\n   - When `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` is `false`, `#clear-sub-btn` (`Clear Students`), `#sub-count-badge`, and `#sub-desc` are hidden \n<truncated 927 bytes>\n%20(1).html) (`16327` bytes) and existing Firestore data (`asd / asd` in `quizzes/active/submissions`) untouched.\n\n### Verification Results (Post-Final Edit)\n- **[verify_auto_record_gate.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_auto_record_gate.cjs) (`exit 0`):** Verified `0` submission POSTs when `autoRecordQuiz: false` (online and offline `#local-db-vault`), `1` POST when `true` or legacy `settings` omitted, `#lkdl` download button visibility on reload, `Notice: This is only available to auto record quiz` rendering with `#clear-sub-btn`/`#sub-count-badge`/`#sub-desc` hidden, `0` submission GETs/intervals when `OFF`, visibility & tab-aware polling, and mid-flight `AbortController` cancellation on toggle OFF.\n- **[verify_stealth_mask.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_stealth_mask.cjs) (`exit 0`):** Silent `.obscure` mask, SVG watermark, `0` violations, and `enableTabViolation=true` checks passed.\n- **[verify_hardened.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_hardened.cjs) (`exit 0`):** `0` comments, `0` forbidden traces (`firebase`/`firestore`/`fetch`/etc.), live quiz load, `#local-db-vault` injection (`612` bytes), and offline vault decryption passed.\n- **[verify_reset_tab.cjs](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/scratch/obf_tool/verify_reset_tab.cjs) (`exit 0`):** Reset tab, remote `lockEpoch` bump on `verify_probe_tmp` (deleted `HTTP 200`), and unlock flow passed.\n\n### Limitations / Unverified\n- Browser visual layout/rendering in live Chromium or mobile devices was not directly exercised (checks ran in mocked Node VM environments alongside live Firestore endpoint calls).\n- If you want the leftover `asd / asd` test record in `quizzes/active/submissions` removed from Firestore, let me know before I touch any stored submission data.","truncated_fields":["content"]}
